;eraMegaten dialogue file. (exclusive)
;Please replace-all X1 and X2 for the character's internal number (the one from CSV). Y1 are used to check assistant's number.
;However, please write single digit numbers as, for example, '04' instead of 4.
;Lines that use PRINTFORM/FORMW/FORML should have a normal (halfwidth) space after the PRINT command to work
;However, these are all deprecated in favor of KSTR WSTR NSTR system - they all use the K number to list them.
;KSTR - "PRINTFORML"
;WSTR - "PRINTFORMW"
;NSTR - "PRINTFORM"
;The purpose of this is so the game can call the more generic responses if there's nothing written for a specific character.
;Just copypaste the ' KSTR:(K++) = ' lines if you need more than one.
;
;Feel free to comment out entire blocks of text, but technically, only the CFLAG:XXX = part needs to be commented out. Just start the line with a colon.
;Conversely, some parts like ending are commented out by default, so remove the colon to eneable them.
;Feel free to ask around and check out the readmes, the jp devs have some of them. 
;-------------------------------------------------

;-------------------------------------------------
;Again, to make file work, replace-all 9000 to the character's number.
;It can also be changed to PUBXXX for personality types.
